WEBVTT

00:00:01.281 --> 00:00:13.159
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.293 --> 00:00:18.865
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.865 --> 00:00:25.794
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.306 --> 00:00:37.342
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.517 --> 00:00:43.457
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.457 --> 00:00:50.863
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:58.672
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.672 --> 00:01:05.545
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.545 --> 00:01:11.151
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.151 --> 00:01:17.424
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.424 --> 00:01:25.854
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:32.539 --> 00:01:35.208
A distant 200 million
light years away,

00:01:35.208 --> 00:01:39.446
there is a shining blue
planet of water like this one.

00:01:39.446 --> 00:01:41.073
Greecia.

00:01:41.214 --> 00:01:43.808
Our home.

00:02:05.138 --> 00:02:08.107
You drew this picture, right?

00:02:13.413 --> 00:02:16.974
Helga wants to go to the place
in that picture, do you know it?

00:02:19.085 --> 00:02:22.213
Those are the moon and
sun of the planet Greecia.

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:28.425
And this is the purification tower that
keeps the oceans of Greecia clean.

00:02:32.999 --> 00:02:37.936
MEMORIES OF GREECIA

00:02:45.178 --> 00:02:49.716
This picture is a view
of our home. And Helga...

00:02:49.716 --> 00:02:52.241
It's the place you come from, too.

00:02:53.286 --> 00:02:57.347
The planet Greecia?
So, Helga's an alien?

00:03:00.694 --> 00:03:03.686
So I guess that means
you guys are aliens, too, right?

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:11.538
Quit fooling around!

00:03:11.538 --> 00:03:14.040
You've been searching for Helga
to tell her something like that?

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.809
It's the truth.

00:03:15.809 --> 00:03:19.079
Get serious!
I've seen this view before.

00:03:19.079 --> 00:03:20.847
It's a view from here on Earth.

00:03:20.847 --> 00:03:24.651
What you've seen is probably a painting
hanging in a Clairmont sanatorium.

00:03:24.651 --> 00:03:26.846
What did you say?!

00:03:29.623 --> 00:03:33.024
Forgive me for saying things
like this all of a sudden.

00:03:36.129 --> 00:03:38.231
You might not believe us,

00:03:38.231 --> 00:03:41.132
but could you listen for
a little while longer?

00:03:42.202 --> 00:03:44.070
I have one request.

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:47.005
Could you answer a few
questions for us?

00:04:06.393 --> 00:04:08.190
What is your name?

00:04:10.597 --> 00:04:12.121
Helga.

00:04:21.641 --> 00:04:23.609
Where were you born?

00:04:24.244 --> 00:04:26.235
Wenda.

00:04:28.982 --> 00:04:32.218
That's a small rural town on
the Eastern Mainland, right?

00:04:32.218 --> 00:04:35.745
And you were always
drawing that picture there.

00:04:40.026 --> 00:04:44.030
There's an old poem on
our home planet Greecia.

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:45.759
Soreto...

00:04:48.535 --> 00:04:50.696
A silver spring in a nighttime...

00:04:52.906 --> 00:04:59.106
A silver spring in a nighttime field,
rises up from far distant depths.

00:05:00.914 --> 00:05:03.850
The tears of the snake that's
lived a thousand years,

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:08.054
trying to bring the beautiful mayfly
back to life a thousand times,

00:05:08.054 --> 00:05:10.454
weeping tears of love.

00:05:11.324 --> 00:05:15.090
A thousand springs,
sparkling like silver.

00:05:26.306 --> 00:05:28.467
Helga?

00:05:30.143 --> 00:05:33.113
That's the legend of the snake
who lived for a thousand years.

00:05:33.113 --> 00:05:34.876
Aghi!

00:05:46.493 --> 00:05:48.628
Helga's wave pattern and...

00:05:48.628 --> 00:05:50.653
...Tina's wave pattern match!

00:05:50.697 --> 00:05:54.030
Yes... There's no mistake!

00:05:56.269 --> 00:05:57.861
Finally...

00:05:58.338 --> 00:06:00.829
Finally, we've met her...

00:06:00.974 --> 00:06:02.839
Aghi.

00:06:12.886 --> 00:06:18.347
We've been searching
for a very, very long time.

00:06:18.892 --> 00:06:25.365
Helga, your real name is that of the
daughter of the King of Greecia, Titus...

00:06:25.365 --> 00:06:27.094
Tina!

00:06:30.737 --> 00:06:32.637
And...

00:06:33.073 --> 00:06:37.305
We were scientists working in the
Tanatulum in the royal palace of Greecia.

00:06:54.494 --> 00:06:59.659
That day, a tragedy occurred
on the planet of Greecia.

00:07:00.333 --> 00:07:04.235
The palace was destroyed to the
point that the ground was torn apart.

00:07:05.638 --> 00:07:07.629
And we...

00:07:07.974 --> 00:07:11.444
Tina, in order to save your soul,

00:07:11.444 --> 00:07:14.047
with the transference
device we had created,

00:07:14.047 --> 00:07:18.685
the Out Zone, we sent your soul
to this planet.

00:07:18.685 --> 00:07:20.710
At our own discretion.

00:07:23.156 --> 00:07:26.493
At the time, there was no better option,

00:07:26.493 --> 00:07:29.223
it was the only thing we could do.

00:07:31.631 --> 00:07:34.734
But... when your father the
king found out about it,

00:07:34.734 --> 00:07:39.105
he became extremely furious and
wouldn't listen to our explanations.

00:07:39.105 --> 00:07:42.597
He ordered us to bring his
daughter back immediately.

00:07:42.809 --> 00:07:45.879
The way the king was at that time,
no matter how we explained it,

00:07:45.879 --> 00:07:48.746
there was no way to
make him understand.

00:07:49.516 --> 00:07:53.219
No matter what our reasons,
as scientists,

00:07:53.219 --> 00:07:55.847
we had taken a course of
action we couldn't take back.

00:07:58.725 --> 00:08:00.660
In order to go after Tina,

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:04.497
using the coordinates of the place
we'd transferred her as our destination,

00:08:04.497 --> 00:08:06.432
what in Earth time was
more than 500 years ago,

00:08:06.432 --> 00:08:08.798
we transferred ourselves to the Earth.

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:16.740
To find your soul and, at the very least,
send it back to Greecia's Zone.

00:08:19.078 --> 00:08:20.613
The Zone?

00:08:20.613 --> 00:08:22.415
You mentioned that on the ship, too.

00:08:22.415 --> 00:08:24.551
Did you guys do that?

00:08:24.551 --> 00:08:26.452
Are you talking about Kirchner?

00:08:26.452 --> 00:08:29.512
Yeah, the man who
disappeared in the black mist.

00:08:31.124 --> 00:08:32.926
What the heck did you do?

00:08:32.926 --> 00:08:35.562
He was a man who had gone
into the Zone and come back.

00:08:35.562 --> 00:08:39.566
Basically, he died and came back
to life in the same body.

00:08:39.566 --> 00:08:41.835
He died and came back to life?!

00:08:41.835 --> 00:08:44.463
That's impossible!

00:08:44.737 --> 00:08:46.573
The only way it's possible

00:08:46.573 --> 00:08:49.098
is by using the Out Zone we created.

00:08:49.342 --> 00:08:51.110
Then it was you guys!

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:52.912
No, you're wrong.

00:08:52.912 --> 00:08:56.015
We don't know the details but
something identical to our Out Zone

00:08:56.015 --> 00:08:58.176
has been created by people on Earth.

00:08:58.484 --> 00:09:00.920
He was just used as a human
guinea pig.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:02.512
Stop it, Hesma.

00:09:02.622 --> 00:09:05.318
Then why did he disappear?!

00:09:08.127 --> 00:09:10.363
The souls that you and we possess,

00:09:10.363 --> 00:09:13.298
are made up of an energy called Orsel.

00:09:13.633 --> 00:09:15.430
Orsel?

00:09:16.135 --> 00:09:20.367
It exists in a very stable
state inside of our bodies,

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:24.900
we live, and then when we die it
enters the Zone in a stable state.

00:09:26.079 --> 00:09:30.641
The world of death, the Zone, is a
world where Orsel must be stable.

00:09:31.084 --> 00:09:33.620
But Kirchner, because of
some kind of experiment

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:35.417
and his own strength of will,

00:09:35.455 --> 00:09:37.480
that stable soul was...

00:09:38.992 --> 00:09:43.452
Basically, the Orsel became unstable.

00:09:44.697 --> 00:09:47.700
Souls are Orsel?!
What's with that?!

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:51.158
When people die, their spirit
passes on! My dad told me that!

00:09:53.339 --> 00:09:56.968
We discovered the Zone
of Death scientifically.

00:09:59.979 --> 00:10:02.582
A separate one exists for each galaxy,

00:10:02.582 --> 00:10:05.176
but at the same time,
it's also one huge dimension.

00:10:06.419 --> 00:10:09.479
The Earth's Zone was
an unknown area to us.

00:10:09.722 --> 00:10:12.850
But we were confident
we could find Tina.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.351
In the year 1478,

00:10:16.696 --> 00:10:19.365
we had been reborn as
humans on Earth,

00:10:19.365 --> 00:10:22.435
and we realized there was
a bigger difference between

00:10:22.435 --> 00:10:25.563
the timescales of Earth and
Greecia than we'd expected.

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:29.035
The coordinates were off.

00:10:30.643 --> 00:10:32.745
That wasn't the only reason,

00:10:32.745 --> 00:10:34.948
but ultimately we spent 26 years...

00:10:34.948 --> 00:10:37.283
No, in Earth time

00:10:37.283 --> 00:10:41.583
it was over 500 years.
Time and again creating an Out Zone,

00:10:41.854 --> 00:10:45.483
and repeatedly reincarnating
ourselves artificially.

00:10:46.225 --> 00:10:50.924
If we'd found you a little sooner,
you wouldn't have suffered.

00:10:53.032 --> 00:10:55.001
Unlike us,

00:10:55.001 --> 00:10:57.337
you repeatedly reincarnated naturally,

00:10:57.337 --> 00:11:00.067
and lost your memories
of Greecia long ago.

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:04.376
But there's no question that
Tina's soul is inside of you.

00:11:04.944 --> 00:11:06.879
And the drawing of that scene

00:11:06.879 --> 00:11:10.280
is a memory of Greecia
that sleeps within you.

00:11:18.992 --> 00:11:21.324
A memory of Greecia...

00:11:22.528 --> 00:11:24.257
You are Tina.

00:11:25.164 --> 00:11:27.598
The princess of the planet Greecia.

00:11:33.373 --> 00:11:35.933
Helga is a princess?!

00:11:38.011 --> 00:11:40.046
If that's...

00:11:40.046 --> 00:11:43.379
If that's really true...

00:11:45.852 --> 00:11:50.390
Before, you said you were going
to return Helga to the Zone, right?

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:51.948
Yes.

00:11:57.263 --> 00:12:00.892
Doesn't that mean you're
going to kill Helga?

00:12:14.514 --> 00:12:16.149
Do you intend to kill Helga?!

00:12:16.149 --> 00:12:17.514
That's what it means, right?!

00:12:23.122 --> 00:12:25.590
Say something! Come on!

00:12:25.792 --> 00:12:27.760
That depends on Helga.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:29.328
Don't try to trick me!

00:12:29.328 --> 00:12:31.853
Didn't you say the Zone
was the world of death?!

00:12:34.367 --> 00:12:36.302
It isn't a lie.

00:12:36.302 --> 00:12:39.238
We came to find out what Helga wants.

00:12:39.238 --> 00:12:41.174
Obviously she doesn't want that!

00:12:41.174 --> 00:12:42.909
You don't have to ask to know that!

00:12:42.909 --> 00:12:46.079
Chitto, you don't have to talk
to these guys! Let's just go!

00:12:46.079 --> 00:12:48.347
Helga, let's go!

00:12:48.347 --> 00:12:49.939
Wait, Chitto.

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:53.876
I want to hear a little more
of what they have to say.

00:12:56.789 --> 00:12:59.392
Helga, there's nothing to listen to!

00:12:59.392 --> 00:13:01.360
Please, Thoma.

00:13:09.402 --> 00:13:10.994
Helga...

00:13:17.076 --> 00:13:19.912
We need a confirmation,
in Tina's own words,

00:13:19.912 --> 00:13:22.181
of what she wants to do.

00:13:22.181 --> 00:13:26.319
In order to do that, we will need
to look back at your past life.

00:13:26.319 --> 00:13:28.685
Could you possibly consider doing that?

00:13:31.891 --> 00:13:33.859
Past life?

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:52.545
Listen, Helga...

00:13:52.545 --> 00:13:55.912
Those guys are trying to kill you!

00:13:57.650 --> 00:13:59.485
Do you understand?

00:13:59.485 --> 00:14:01.487
This is about you!

00:14:01.487 --> 00:14:03.222
That's right, Helga!

00:14:03.222 --> 00:14:06.248
We should just get away
from these people.

00:14:08.261 --> 00:14:13.366
But, I don't know how to explain it but...

00:14:13.366 --> 00:14:16.301
What they told me...

00:14:17.637 --> 00:14:20.606
warmed my heart.

00:14:20.606 --> 00:14:23.803
But Helga! You'd be killed!

00:14:28.181 --> 00:14:32.641
You aren't thinking of doing
what they tell you, are you?

00:14:38.691 --> 00:14:40.454
Helga...

00:14:45.464 --> 00:14:48.524
Do you think she believed
what we told her?

00:14:55.341 --> 00:14:58.777
Kill... Helga...

00:15:03.115 --> 00:15:06.346
I never thought about it that way.

00:15:06.586 --> 00:15:10.056
Not even once until now.

00:15:10.056 --> 00:15:15.153
Have we... just been killing
ourselves all this time?

00:15:15.695 --> 00:15:19.565
What are you talking about?! It was all
for the sake of finding Tina, wasn't it?!

00:15:19.565 --> 00:15:22.201
We and Tina are all people
from Greecia!

00:15:22.201 --> 00:15:25.500
It's wrong for us to be here!
We don't exist on Earth!

00:15:25.771 --> 00:15:28.407
When something doesn't exist
you can't kill it or anything else!

00:15:28.407 --> 00:15:30.807
Even though you're a
scientist you don't know that?!

00:15:33.846 --> 00:15:36.974
I don't know.

00:15:43.789 --> 00:15:46.192
We'll be able to go back to
Greecia soon.

00:15:46.192 --> 00:15:49.719
That's where our real lives are.

00:15:50.029 --> 00:15:53.021
We'll all go back together.
Right, Aghi?

00:15:58.504 --> 00:16:00.473
It's been bothering me but...

00:16:00.473 --> 00:16:03.309
You saw what happened
with Kirchner, didn't you?

00:16:03.309 --> 00:16:05.300
It was the same as what
happened with Tina.

00:16:08.247 --> 00:16:11.717
The Enma trying to destroy
Kirchner's soul,

00:16:11.717 --> 00:16:13.878
the barrier of darkness, everything,

00:16:14.287 --> 00:16:16.956
were the actions of the universe.

00:16:16.956 --> 00:16:20.722
The repair process we'd
theoretically hypothesized.

00:16:22.828 --> 00:16:25.865
When it happened with Tina,
it wasn't completely clear,

00:16:25.865 --> 00:16:28.265
but this proves it.

00:16:28.634 --> 00:16:33.406
The will of the universe would not
allow Kirchner to exist as a monster.

00:16:33.406 --> 00:16:36.136
The fate of a soul that
defies divine providence.

00:16:38.477 --> 00:16:41.080
Just as it couldn't allow Kirchner to exist,

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:43.883
it also can't allow our actions
in reincarnating ourselves.

00:16:43.883 --> 00:16:48.718
But, thanks to you
Kirchner's soul was saved.

00:16:51.023 --> 00:16:52.525
And in the end...

00:16:52.525 --> 00:16:55.394
we're going to return to our
original bodies like Kirchner did.

00:16:55.394 --> 00:16:57.697
We need to transfer
our souls one last time!

00:16:57.697 --> 00:17:00.165
We can't be defeated by the Enma yet!

00:17:05.738 --> 00:17:08.138
Our bodies...

00:17:09.475 --> 00:17:11.577
Hopefully, the chaos on Greecia

00:17:11.577 --> 00:17:15.377
hasn't reached our preserved bodies.

00:17:39.171 --> 00:17:42.436
The planet... Greecia.

00:18:27.953 --> 00:18:31.557
Thoma! Thoma!
What's the matter? Thoma!

00:18:31.557 --> 00:18:33.081
Thoma!

00:18:57.550 --> 00:19:00.576
S-Stop it, Thoma! Stop it!

00:19:06.859 --> 00:19:09.225
I'm sorry, Helga.

00:19:31.183 --> 00:19:33.777
Have you thought about it?

00:19:38.791 --> 00:19:42.124
You're agreeing to look
back at your past life?

00:19:44.063 --> 00:19:45.064
Helga!

00:19:45.064 --> 00:19:46.765
Why?!
These people...

00:19:46.765 --> 00:19:48.300
It's okay.

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:50.962
I realized something...

00:19:51.403 --> 00:19:54.338
I'm sure that the place I'm looking for

00:19:55.307 --> 00:19:57.571
is in that past life.

00:19:58.043 --> 00:20:00.204
Helga...

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:04.247
I can feel it, Thoma.

00:20:07.319 --> 00:20:08.687
I'm glad.

00:20:08.687 --> 00:20:10.890
First, your life just before this one,

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:13.688
the artist named Serafine,
painted a picture

00:20:13.726 --> 00:20:16.829
that's in a Clairmont sanatorium.
Let's go there.

00:20:16.829 --> 00:20:19.465
Wait a minute! There's
something we have to do first.

00:20:19.465 --> 00:20:20.898
Wonder!

00:20:22.368 --> 00:20:25.860
One at a time, could you each
call Wonder by her name?

00:20:25.971 --> 00:20:27.871
Helga, you go first.

00:20:30.442 --> 00:20:32.137
Wonder!

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:36.615
-And you are?
-Chitto.

00:20:36.615 --> 00:20:38.050
Okay, Chitto!

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:39.642
Wonder!

00:20:43.355 --> 00:20:46.256
Come on, you're next.
What's your name?

00:20:47.159 --> 00:20:49.184
Please, Thoma.

00:20:50.029 --> 00:20:52.031
Thoma.

00:20:52.031 --> 00:20:54.199
She can't hear you!

00:20:54.199 --> 00:20:56.292
I'm Thoma, Wonder!

00:20:57.403 --> 00:21:00.806
Okay! Now Wonder will protect
all of you!

00:21:00.806 --> 00:21:02.933
She's a dependable robot.

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:08.347
I am Aghi.
And this is Soreto, Tarlant,

00:21:08.347 --> 00:21:10.583
Hesma and Hasmodye.

00:21:10.583 --> 00:21:13.575
All right, Wonder! It's just
a short trip to Clairmont!

00:21:16.622 --> 00:21:19.525
Just a little longer and we'll be
able to go back to Greecia!

00:21:19.525 --> 00:21:22.460
It's not as if Tina's memories
have returned yet.

00:21:22.795 --> 00:21:24.129
It's only just begun...

00:21:24.129 --> 00:21:25.391
-Let's go.
-Aghi!

00:21:27.066 --> 00:21:30.399
The messy way that Kirchner
died is bothering me.

00:21:30.569 --> 00:21:33.402
And it seems there were
others who died the same way.

00:21:34.273 --> 00:21:37.710
At this rate, we'll end up facing
the same fate.

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:40.645
So, before we go back,
I want to get ahold of

00:21:40.713 --> 00:21:42.738
the data from Kirchner's experiment.

00:22:08.641 --> 00:22:11.474
A little longer, Big Sister.

00:22:11.910 --> 00:22:16.006
Just a little longer and I'll be
able to bring you back to life.

00:22:34.667 --> 00:22:44.474
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:44.743 --> 00:22:54.586
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:54.586 --> 00:22:59.319
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:22:59.358 --> 00:23:04.193
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:04.596 --> 00:23:13.732
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:13.839 --> 00:23:18.911
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:18.911 --> 00:23:24.183
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:24.183 --> 00:23:28.586
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:28.620 --> 00:23:32.925
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:32.925 --> 00:23:37.794
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
